    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "References in this section to voting power the exercise of which is controlled by a director include voting power whose exercise is controlled by a body corporate controlled by him"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether the director controls the body corporate is this section's answer for another body corporate

-- src:3356 | (5) Shares in a company held as treasury shares, and any voting rights attached to such shares, are disregarded for the purposes of this section.
@ref s 255(5) treasury shares (src:3356-3356)
GIVEN `the shares are held as treasury shares` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 255(5) the shares and their voting rights are disregarded` MEANS
    IF `the shares are held as treasury shares`
